{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nPlots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement [[cite:obs-319219af2eb8e2667c63201402ee5be0c3a9f640 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]. Each plot, or allotment, is forty square metres in size [[cite:obs-7ced6dc20a58dfeb5043987722cba4b84e354b73 \"Allotments: forty square metres each; hedge trimming before October.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the agreement's allocation rule for plots and the size of each plot with exact citations from the sources obs-319219af2eb8e2667c63201402ee5be0c3a9f640 and obs-7ced6dc20a58dfeb5043987722cba4b84e354b73 as requested."}